    <div class="section">

        <h2>About the Design Suite</h2>

        <p>
            SAS Engineering is a browser-based engineering calculation
            suite developed for selected pressure vessel design
            calculations based on ASME BPVC Section VIII, Division 1.
        </p>

        <p>
            The objective is to make commonly used pressure vessel
            calculations easier to access, understand and review.
        </p>

        <p>
            The suite focuses on engineering transparency by showing
            design inputs, calculation parameters and resulting
            engineering checks rather than providing only a final number.
        </p>

    </div>


    <div class="section">

        <h2>Current Modules</h2>


        <h3>Pressure Boundaries</h3>

        <div class="module">
            <strong>UG-27 — Internal Pressure: Shell Thickness</strong>
            <br>
            Cylindrical and spherical shell calculations.
        </div>

        <div class="module">
            <strong>UG-32 — Formed Heads</strong>
            <br>
            Ellipsoidal, torispherical and hemispherical heads.
        </div>

        <div class="module">
            <strong>UG-28 — External Pressure: Cylindrical Shells</strong>
            <br>
            External pressure and buckling evaluation.
        </div>

        <div class="module">
            <strong>UG-33 — External Pressure: Formed Heads</strong>
            <br>
            External pressure evaluation for formed heads.
        </div>


        <h3>Openings, Reinforcement & Welds</h3>

        <div class="module">
            <strong>UG-37 — Opening Reinforcement</strong>
            <br>
            Required and available reinforcement area evaluation.
        </div>

        <div class="module">
            <strong>UG-37 / UG-40 — Nozzle Reinforcement</strong>
            <br>
            Reinforcement pad and nozzle-related calculations.
        </div>

        <div class="module">
            <strong>UW-16 — Weld Sizing</strong>
            <br>
            Weld sizing and joint efficiency calculations.
        </div>


        <h3>Flanges & Bolted Connections</h3>

        <div class="module">
            <strong>Appendix 2 — Flange Design</strong>
            <br>
            Operating and seating moment calculations.
        </div>


        <h3>Stress, MAWP & MDMT</h3>

        <div class="module">
            <strong>UG-23 — Stress Limits</strong>
            <br>
            General stress limit evaluation.
        </div>

        <div class="module">
            <strong>UG-34 — Unstayed Flat Heads</strong>
            <br>
            Flat head thickness calculations.
        </div>

        <div class="module">
            <strong>UG-98 / UG-99 — MAWP & Testing</strong>
            <br>
            MAWP and pressure testing calculations.
        </div>

        <div class="module">
            <strong>UCS-66 — MDMT / Brittle Fracture</strong>
            <br>
            Material temperature and exemption curve evaluation.
        </div>

    </div>


